==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} [[salutatio]] “a greeting, a wishing health to,” from [[saluto]] “wish one’s health, greet,” from [[salus]] “well-being.” Compare the {{etyl|la}} greeting ''[[salvere|salve]]'' “be well.”

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
{{wikipedia}}

# A [[greeting]], [[salute]], or [[address]]; a [[hello]].
# The act of greeting.
# The title in your name, such as Mr, Mrs, Ms., Dr. or Rev..

